 "notes": {
  "brandtitle": {
   "x": 0,
   "y": -300,
   "text": "Final Meal — brand & screens",
   "kind": "title1",
   "maxW": 2640
  },
  "questions": {
   "x": 2720,
   "y": 0,
   "w": 440,
   "fill": "orange",
   "text": "Open questions\n\n1. Skull: keep as-is, soften, or pair with a plate/knife mark?\n2. Private members: can followers still see their name? Can they be followed at all?\n3. Ads: how often in the feed (every 5th card?), and sold directly to restaurants or through an ad network?\n4. Web link domain + list URL format."
  },
  "decided": {
   "x": 3220,
   "y": 0,
   "w": 440,
   "fill": "green",
   "text": "Decided\n\n• Name: Final Meal\n• Wordmark: Instrument Serif\n• Colour: ember + ember glow only\n• Skull marks Final Meal only; Honorable is a bone dot / outline badge\n• Sharing is link-first; shared lists are live\n• Links open on the web unless the app is installed; the web page pushes sign-up\n• Welcome: map version\n• Sign-in: Apple, Google or email code; no phone number\n• Everyone starts Public; Private is a setting (private picks stay on the map without a name)\n• Add a dish is one step; tags expand inline\n• Lists and Honorable are grouped by restaurant; the Final Meal tab always shows the five separately\n• Photo, note and tags are all optional\n• Tags: fixed list (searchable, larger) + personal custom tags\n• Money: ads in the feed; $5 one-time to remove"
  },
